{"code":"ms-MY","name":"Malay","native":"Bahasa Melayu","variant":"Malaysia","badge":"MS","tts":"ms-MY","about":"Malaysian Malay. Close to Indonesian, so most lines work in both countries, but everyday words differ: tandas, not toilet; faham, not mengerti.","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Saya tak faham.","say":"SA-ya tak FA-ham","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Saya tak tahu.","say":"SA-ya tak TA-hu","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Sekejap, ya.","say":"se-KE-jap, ya","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Boleh ulang sekali lagi?","say":"BO-leh U-lang se-KA-li LA-gi","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Perlahan sikit, ya.","say":"per-LA-han SI-kit, ya","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Apa “…” dalam bahasa Melayu?","say":"A-pa … DA-lam ba-HA-sa me-LA-yu","en":"What’s “…” in Malay?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Boleh.","say":"BO-leh","en":"Sure. / Can do.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course","hook":"Boleh = can. You’ll hear it all day: “Boleh, boleh.”"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Betul.","say":"be-TUL","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Rasanya ya.","say":"RA-sa-nya ya","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Ya ke?","say":"YA ke","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Tak apa.","say":"tak A-pa","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Bagus!","say":"BA-gus","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Di mana {x}?","say":"di MA-na {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Saya nak {x}.","say":"SA-ya NAK {x}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Ada {x}?","say":"A-da {x}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"Minta {x}.","say":"MIN-ta {x}","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Saya kena {x}.","say":"SA-ya ke-NA {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Boleh saya {x}?","say":"BO-leh SA-ya {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Saya semak dulu.","say":"SA-ya SE-mak DU-lu","en":"Let me check first.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Saya ada mesyuarat.","say":"SA-ya A-da me-SHU-a-rat","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Pedas tak?","say":"pe-DAS tak","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Tak nak bawang, ya.","say":"tak NAK BA-wang, ya","en":"No onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Apa yang sedap kat sini?","say":"A-pa yang se-DAP kat SI-ni","en":"What’s good here?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Saya tak makan daging.","say":"SA-ya tak MA-kan DA-ging","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"},{"id":"x.T11","t":"Kira!","say":"KI-ra","en":"The bill! (the usual way to ask at a stall)"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Berapa harga ni?","say":"be-RA-pa HAR-ga ni","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Tengok-tengok je.","say":"TE-ngok TE-ngok je","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Saya ambil yang ini.","say":"SA-ya AM-bil yang I-ni","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Boleh bayar guna kad?","say":"BO-leh BA-yar GU-na kad","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Jauh tak?","say":"JA-uh tak","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"Ke lapangan terbang, ya.","say":"ke la-PA-ngan ter-BANG, ya","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"kiri · kanan · terus","say":"KI-ri · KA-nan · te-RUS","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Tolong!","say":"TO-long","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Tak ada tisu tandas.","say":"tak A-da TI-su TAN-das","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Saya rasa tak sihat.","say":"SA-ya RA-sa tak SI-hat","en":"I don’t feel well.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Tolong panggil ambulans.","say":"TO-long PANG-gil AM-bu-lans","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Selamat berkenalan.","say":"se-LA-mat ber-ke-NA-lan","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Asal dari mana?","say":"A-sal da-ri MA-na","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Kerja apa?","say":"KER-ja A-pa","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Sedapnya!","say":"se-DAP-nya","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Helo.","say":"HE-lo","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Selamat pagi.","say":"se-LA-mat PA-gi","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Apa khabar?","say":"A-pa KHA-bar","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Ya. · Tidak.","say":"ya · TI-dak","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Tolong. · Sila.","say":"TO-long · SI-la","en":"Please. (asking · offering)"},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Terima kasih.","say":"te-RI-ma KA-sih","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Maaf.","say":"ma-AF","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Jumpa lagi.","say":"JUM-pa LA-gi","en":"See you. / Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"satu · dua · tiga","say":"SA-tu · DU-a · TI-ga","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"empat · lima · enam","say":"EM-pat · LI-ma · e-NAM","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"tujuh · lapan · sembilan","say":"TU-juh · LA-pan · sem-BI-lan","en":"7 · 8 · 9","hook":"Eight is lapan here, delapan in Indonesian."},{"id":"b2.4","t":"sepuluh · dua puluh · seratus","say":"se-PU-luh · DU-a PU-luh · se-RA-tus","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Epal itu merah.","say":"E-pal I-tu ME-rah","en":"The apple is red.","note":"no “is” · itu (that) works like “the”"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Saya makan epal.","say":"SA-ya MA-kan E-pal","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"same order as English · verbs never change"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Saya sudah makan epal.","say":"SA-ya SU-dah MA-kan E-pal","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"sudah (already) marks the past"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Saya nak makan epal.","say":"SA-ya NAK MA-kan E-pal","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"nak + verb = want to"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Awak makan epal?","say":"A-wak MA-kan E-pal","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"the voice goes up (or start with Adakah)"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"tandas","say":"TAN-das","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"farmasi","say":"far-MA-si","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"hospital","say":"HOS-pi-tal","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"stesen","say":"STE-sen","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"lapangan terbang","say":"la-PA-ngan ter-BANG","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"hotel","say":"HO-tel","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"air kosong","say":"A-ir KO-song","en":"water (plain)","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"kopi","say":"KO-pi","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"bil","say":"bil","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"menu","say":"ME-nu","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"bir","say":"bir","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"yang ini","say":"yang I-ni","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"beg plastik","say":"beg PLAS-tik","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"mesyuarat","say":"me-SHU-a-rat","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"fail","say":"fa-IL","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"skrin","say":"skrin","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"mesej","say":"ME-sej","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"esok","say":"E-sok","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"pergi","say":"per-GI","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"masuk","say":"MA-suk","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"bayar","say":"BA-yar","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Alahan · sila baca","ask":"Adakah makanan ini mengandungi mana-mana bahan ini?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Terima kasih banyak!","note":"Peanuts are in satay sauce, nasi lemak sambal and rojak. Many sambals contain belacan (shrimp paste).","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Saya ada alahan teruk terhadap kacang tanah. Saya tidak boleh makan kacang tanah atau minyak kacang.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Saya ada alahan teruk terhadap makanan laut bercangkerang (udang, ketam, kerang).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Saya tidak boleh makan gluten (gandum).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Saya vegetarian. Saya tidak makan daging, ayam atau ikan.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Saya tidak makan babi.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"TANDAS","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"LELAKI · WANITA","en":"Men · Women"},{"t":"KELUAR · MASUK","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"TOLAK · TARIK","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"PINTU KECEMASAN","en":"Emergency exit"}]}